# Backend API Rules

## API Route Definitions (implement exactly these prototype routes)

GET  /api/counties
     Returns: {"counties": ["Carlow", "Cavan", ...]}  # sorted alphabetically

GET  /api/historical
     Returns: [{"county": str, "year": int, "score": float}, ...]
     Source: sustainability_scores.csv (130 rows, real data only)

GET  /api/forecast
     Returns: [{"county": str, "year": int, "predicted_score": float,
                "lower_5pct": float, "upper_95pct": float}, ...]
     Source: forecast_2026_2030.csv merged with uncertainty_bands.csv

GET  /api/pillars/{county}
     Returns: [{"year": int, "reproductive_efficiency": float,
                "genetic_management": float, "herd_health": float,
                "herd_management": float}, ...]
     Covers both historical years (2021-2025) and forecast years (2026-2030)

POST /api/pillars/preview
     Body:    {"county": "Kerry", "interventions": {"calving_interval": -0.05,
               "recycled_cows_pct": 0.08}}
     Returns: {"before": {"P1": float, "P2": float, "P3": float, "P4": float},
               "after":  {"P1": float, "P2": float, "P3": float, "P4": float},
               "delta":  {"P1": float, "P2": float, "P3": float, "P4": float}}
     Lightweight pure transform endpoint for slider previews only; do not run STGNN here.

POST /api/counterfactual
     Body:    {"county": "Kerry", "interventions": {"calving_interval": -0.05,
               "recycled_cows_pct": 0.08}, "horizon": 5}
     Returns: {"baseline": [{"year": int, "score": float}],
               "counterfactual": [{"year": int, "score": float}],
               "uplift": [{"year": int, "delta": float}],
               "pillar_shifts": {"P1_delta": float, "P2_delta": float,
                                 "P3_delta": float, "P4_delta": float},
               "explanation": str}

GET  /api/comparison
     Returns prototype baseline comparison:
       {"stgnn": [...], "linear_trend": [...], "county_mean": [...]}

GET  /api/metrics
     Returns training metrics: {"train_r2": float, "val_r2": float,
                                  "test_r2": float, "mae": float, "mse": float}

## Startup Behavior in main.py
@app.on_event("startup")
async def startup():
    if not Path("backend/models/stgnn_forecast_weights.pt").exists():
        run_full_pipeline()   # imports run_pipeline.py
    else:
        load_cached_results() # load CSVs into memory

## CORS — Required
from fastapi.middleware.cors import CORSMiddleware
app.add_middleware(CORSMiddleware, allow_origins=["http://localhost:5173"],
                   allow_methods=["*"], allow_headers=["*"])

## Error Handling Pattern
@app.exception_handler(Exception)
async def global_handler(request, exc):
    return JSONResponse(status_code=500,
                        content={"error": str(exc), "phase": "unknown"})
